<view class="page page-has-footer"><nav-bar title="脱敏长图预览" />
  <view class="pad" wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="skeleton detail-skeleton"></view></view>
  <view class="pad" wx:elif="{{error}}"><view class="card card-p"><text class="h2">暂时无法生成预览</text><text class="sub mt-12">{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary mt-24" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view></view>
  <view class="pad" wx:elif="{{!canShare}}"><view class="card card-p"><text class="h2">{{preview.generating ? '报告仍在生成中' : '这条记录暂不可分享'}}</text><text class="sub mt-12">仅完整且有权限查看的报告或成果，才能生成对应脱敏长图。</text><button class="btn btn-secondary mt-24" bindtap="load">刷新状态</button></view></view>
  <view class="pad" wx:else>
    <view class="preview-intro"><text class="h3">{{preview.targetType === 'achievement' ? '成果' : '报告'}} · PNG 图片</text><text class="sub mt-8">已隐藏：{{hiddenText || '全名、设备及家庭敏感信息'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{generatingImage}}" class="card card-p image-state"><text class="h3">正在生成实际图片…</text><text class="sub mt-12">内容较多时需要稍候，完成后即可预览与保存。</text></view>
    <view wx:elif="{{imageError}}" class="card card-p image-state"><text class="h3">图片暂未生成</text><text class="sub mt-12">{{imageError}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary mt-20" bindtap="generate">重新生成图片</button></view>
    <image wx:elif="{{filePath}}" class="share-image" src="{{filePath}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="previewImage" aria-label="点击打开脱敏长图" />
    <view class="privacy-tip mt-16"><text>请先检查内容再保存。保存成功后，可在相册中自主选择分享给谁。</text></view>
    <view class="save-error mt-16" wx:if="{{saveError}}"><text>{{saveError}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <canvas class="export-canvas" canvas-id="shareCanvas" style="width: 375px; height: {{canvasHeight}}px;"></canvas>
  <view class="page-fixed-footer" wx:if="{{canShare && !error}}"><button class="btn btn-secondary" disabled="{{!filePath}}" bindtap="previewImage">打开图片</button><button class="btn btn-primary" disabled="{{!filePath || saving}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存到相册</button></view>
</view>
